  "implementation_changes": "commit 2274e808433568aa1d8042bf9e3cb1f1de338b4b\nAuthor:     Marcelo Cantos <marcelo.cantos@gmail.com>\nAuthorDate: Wed Nov 4 22:08:42 2026 +1100\nCommit:     Marcelo Cantos <marcelo.cantos@gmail.com>\nCommitDate: Wed Nov 4 22:08:42 2026 +1100\n\n    fix: preserve TIM trie lookup named binding and iterator termination\n    \n    Implement precommitted accounts 02fa49de2396c1445a4ddf1a783c973f883a82f4.\n    Keep exact memory names and UTF-16 prefix history in mutation-coupled indexes;\n    read named values without consumption for repeated formals. Empty sub replay\n    stops the current execution iterator and retains its evaluated prefix, while\n    nested execution restores caller lifetime. Factory welcome selection remains\n    an explicit downstream dependency. Preserve all original unit inputs.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\n crates/rustuml-parser/src/preprocess/mod.rs | 420 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----\n 1 file changed, 370 insertions(+), 50 deletions(-)\n",
